/apps/754320/extras/75232122fb0262ca855ba70b5034be6b.mp4?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bad guys can jump out at you from anywhere and each gang in Pinnacle City has its own devastating attacks! But you can beat 'em back in turn-based combat using timed hits and blocks to increase or reduce damage. You can also partner with your entourage members to unleash devastating combo attacks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/1774c7f14ee7ce43c1485ea6feaeaaac.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Manuscripts teach entourage members a wide variety of skills. Learned skills can then be upgraded by skill points you get from solving major cases. With each upgrade, skills become more powerful, and your entourage can take on even more powerful enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/7aa2823f5c760d71dc79e892c1c4c67b.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Tune up your gear with modifications to fit your play style. Experiment with different mods and ammo types to deal varying types of damage and inflict status effects on enemies. Whether you prefer a technical approach or go in guns blazing, modifying your gear is key as you battle your way through the city.<br><br></strong>",
            "short_description": "Untangle a gripping conspiracy in this noir-influenced mystery, laced with classic RPG elements. Navigate seedy streets to collect clues, upgrade skills and customize weapons. Brawl in turn-based combat with timed hits &amp; combos, to reveal the dark truth that plagues the city’s core and your sanity.",
